    "description": "Title\n: 10 Assorted Color Hemingray Insulator's\nCountry of origin\n: United States\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nDepartment\n: Collectibles > Local Interest\nCondition\n: Used\nDescription\n: Bring a touch of industrial history to your space with this collection of 10 assorted color Hemingray glass insulators. Each piece offers its unique patina, displaying hues of clear, aqua, and light green glass with vintage charm and visible air bubbles, mold seams, and embossed markings. These insulators, once used on telegraph and telephone poles, now offer collectors and decorators a glimpse into classic American utility design. Whether grouped together or displayed individually, their rounded shapes and subtle imperfections enhance their visual appeal. The glass construction ensures long-lasting durability, while the recognizable Hemingray embossing adds legitimacy and collector value. Ideal for display in a curio cabinet, as paperweights, or for upcycling in home decor projects, this lot brings both style and history. All items are in used condition with some signs of age, minor dirt, and expected wear, but no obvious major cracks or chips. Perfect for collectors or those seeking distinctive vintage decor",
